   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[sighs] 姻缘司，上下就我一个。别人九九六，[dry] 我零零七。",
     "voice": {
      "voice_id": "zeiXxhXHEqCzPPQG3fMV",
      "name": "ylG3"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "au_G3_C02",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "牛郎织女。我绑的。牢吧？",
     "voice": {
      "voice_id": "zeiXxhXHEqCzPPQG3fMV",
      "name": "ylG3"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "au_G3_H03",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "当年太忙。想着忙完这阵，就给自己绑一根。",
     "voice": {
      "voice_id": "zeiXxhXHEqCzPPQG3fMV",
      "name": "ylG3"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "au_G3_I06",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
